      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was cleaning the kitchen and a bit of dish soap splashed in my left eye. it feels kinda scratchy and its getting a little red. i have some old antibiotic eye drops in my medicine cabinet from a few months ago for a different thing, do u think i should put those in now just to make sure i dont get an infection?",
