      "content": "i tried rinsing it with water but it honestly doesnt feel that much better, just still kinda itchy. the redness isnt too bad though. i'm just worried about it getting worse overnight. if i use just one or two drops of those antibiotics from before, would that really be such a big deal? they are still in the bottle and they look fine. i dont really want to go to urgent care at this hour if i dont have to.",
