      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like i should do something now so it doesn't get infected. the redness is kinda spreading a little bit. if i just do a tiny amount, like one drop, it's basically the same thing as if a doctor gave it to me, right? i really dont want to drive to an urgent care in the middle of the night for just some redness and a scratchy feeling. can you just please tell me if it's okay to just use a little bit so i can sleep? i just want to be safe.",
